1
00:00:00,126 --> 00:00:03,716
(Sheldon:)...I don't think the two of you
would be comfortable on the couch.

2
00:00:04,714 --> 00:00:07,214
-So, what do you want?
-It's not what I want.

3
00:00:07,383 --> 00:00:09,973
(Sheldon:)It's what evolution wants.
Human beings are primates.

4
00:00:10,136 --> 00:00:14,226
(Sheldon:)Primates have evolved to live in groups
both for protection and support.

5
00:00:14,932 --> 00:00:17,602
(Leonard:)But you don't like other people.

6
00:00:17,768 --> 00:00:19,938
(Sheldon:)I do tonight.

7
00:00:20,897 --> 00:00:23,277
(Sheldon:)It's scary over there.

8
00:00:23,858 --> 00:00:26,648
(Leonard:)It's getting scary here too.

9
00:00:33,242 --> 00:00:34,782
(Policeman:)Um....

10
00:00:34,952 --> 00:00:37,292
"Three Little Kittens"?

11
00:00:38,831 --> 00:00:41,461
"Three Little Pigs"?

12
00:00:42,835 --> 00:00:44,125
[SIGHS]

13
00:00:44,295 --> 00:00:46,335
(Penny:)God, I don't know.

14
00:00:46,506 --> 00:00:47,966
(Penny:)Star Wars?

15
00:00:48,466 --> 00:00:49,506
[BELL DINGS]

16
00:00:49,675 --> 00:00:51,845
(Leonard:)Did we win? Can we go to bed?

17
00:00:52,053 --> 00:00:54,093
(Sheldon:)Good Lord, I could not have
made this easier.

18
00:00:54,263 --> 00:01:00,023
A hydrogen atom, H,
plus pigs minus P, "higs."

